  "description": "Find the maximum number of consecutive 1s in an array if you can flip at most k 0s.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "let left = 0, right = 0, zeros = 0, maxLen = 0;\nwhile (right < nums.length) {\n  if (nums[right] === 0) zeros++;\n  while (zeros > k) {\n    if (nums[left] === 0) zeros--;\n    left++;\n  }\n  maxLen = Math.max(maxLen, right - left + 1);\n  right++;\n}",
